t(20, 1395, """My dear brother .. the finest brother .. My dear brother .. your children hate you .. My dear brother .. only my children and I love you .. My dear brother .. the finest brother .. Homes where Satan has settled and nested .. The Ummah will go on suffering as long as there are people who live this way .. the speaker and the listener""")

