t(22, 1800, """A young man who has not spoken to his father for 30 years .. He sits before him in silence .. I asked him: why? He said: Whenever I spoke, I was made to sit for long hours being punished because I had voiced my opinion .. Whenever I uttered a word I was insulted and told: be quiet .. shut up .. And whenever I voiced an opinion the gates of hell opened on me. He says: I have not spoken to him for 30 years .. I asked him: And does that please him? He said: It is as if he never made a mistake in his life .. He tells me: I don't know why you don't talk to me .. He tells me: You are an undutiful son because you don't speak to me .. I said to him: Tell him the reason. He replied: If I told him the reason, a gate of hell would open on me like the one that always used to open .. I would be berated and humiliated .. I fell silent and found nothing to say to him! Do you want to know more about what goes on behind the doors of homes?""")

t(23, 660, """A message that reached me .. For 7 hours on end a father berates his son .. The reason is that he voiced an opinion .. The young man tells me: Because I voiced my opinion he sat me before him for seven hours, telling me what his father's wife did to him and what tragedies have befallen him from his birth to this day .. I asked him: Only because you voiced your opinion .. He said: Yes, merely because I voiced my opinion on a political news item! Do you want to know more about what crimes take place inside homes?""")

t(23, 1820, """Hand over your salary .. hand it over .. Your salary is for me and my children only .. Your children from the first wife have grown up, so let them go and work .. It doesn't matter whether they finish their studies .. A message, God willing, to plague the head of every woman like this .. Stories repeated in every street and city .. that make the brow sweat with shame .. How many homes have fallen .. children been cast out .. little ones been lost .. and former wives died of oppression, grief and heartbreak!""")

t(24, 550, """Shut up .. You are forbidden to voice your opinion .. You only listen, carry out and obey .. A morning message on the head of every tyrant father on earth .. Fear Allah regarding yourselves before you fear Him regarding your children! By Allah .. what reaches me makes the brow sweat with shame, the eyes weep and the rock split in pity and compassion for the state of children you have broken and ruined""")

t(24, 1710, """When the child is berated not for a mistake he committed .. but only because he has an opinion! Your silence is a betrayal of your child .. Your silence is a mark of shame .. Spread awareness, for in Arab homes especially, daily crimes are committed against our children""")

