t(26, 1090, """My dear ones .. Today I will speak from my own whim .. so listen to me well .. Today I will lie .. Today I will launch a lie both old and new .. Today I will lead you astray .. I will take you to where you go astray while you think I am guiding you!""")

t(26, 2235, """We are not waiting for them to be released .. rather they have already been released .. The bridled devils are no longer bridled .. They are before us on the screens with Muslim faces .. They talk to us about religion .. they talk to us about the end times .. they talk to us about the Mahdi .. they talk to the people .. Most people do not see the reality of the one sitting in front of the phone camera .. Only a few know!""")

t(27, 850, """If only the owner of any pulpit, before staying up all night to launch slander against Allah's creatures and hurl accusations at them .. if only he would look at this picture .. Perhaps he would be a little afraid!""")

t(27, 2010, """When every morning dawns with a new accusation .. one cannot help longing for departure .. This scale of hatred .. and this amount of loathing! But patience, for one day will be the most beautiful day: the day of leaving .. the day of being rid of all the scoundrels on earth and leaving the earth to them, to eat food and have more of the earth's garlic, lentils and onions! On that day, may they enjoy a cheap world for which they have shown their constant greed, for their souls will never be reformed""")

t(28, 675, """Many of those who speak do not see how the sky above them looks .. They talk .. they speak falsehoods, while the truth is that the sky above them is red, ablaze .. They speak falsehoods with full confidence, and the crows caw above them while they do not know! They think those above them are eagles!! They caw to warn them, but they do not realize that they are crossing the bridge between truth and falsehood; they cross and do not realize they are crossing!""")

t(28, 1820, """They will be brought in, O people of Sudan, by the might of our Lord, the Avenger, the Subduer over them and over His servants .. It is only a trial .. and you have been tested .. so be patient .. The outcome belongs to the God-fearing .. and to the patient""")

