t(35, 475, """A story and a picture: The foreigner points proudly at the picture, but the AI did not show the picture correctly. Suddenly the foreigner hangs a picture of Ben-Gurion in his office for the first time!! A resignation from an institution whose owner points at Ben-Gurion and says: This is one of our leaders! An institution in an Arab country .. The foreign person's picture is symbolic, since the person in the picture does not match the appearance of the real person .. The incident was in 2010 .. Nationality English, and the religion not Jewish .. And yet the loyalty is firm, because the agenda against the Ummah is deep-rooted, hidden under the names of companies, institutions and perhaps even grocery shops .. No matter .. They penetrate everything .. A resignation and leaving a job with a very high salary for that time .. a salary higher than high .. And the reason is a picture .. Yes .. Because we cannot live in humiliation, even if we dwell on the pavements, drink stagnant water and eat carrion .. But we will not kneel .. we will not bow .. we will not sell""")

